'''The Stranger's island'''<ref name="AcolyteVG">''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> was located on<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" /> the ocean [[planet]]<ref name="AcolyteVG">''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> [[Bal'demnic]]<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-10-24.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-10-24}}</ref> and was home to the [[Sith Lord]] "[[the Stranger]]" during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" /> In [[132 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TheAcolyteDate}}</ref> [[Verosha Aniseya]] was brought to the island by the Stranger.<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The island first appeared in the live-action [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte]]'' in the episode "[[Teach / Corrupt]]" on [[July 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" /> It is shot and located in [[wikipedia:Portugal|Portugal]] on the island of [[wikipedia:Madeira|Madeira]].<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=teach-corrupt-trivia-gallery-the-acolyte|text="Teach / Corrupt" Trivia Gallery &#124; The Acolyte}} {{C|Slide 2}}</ref>

